Package: grillr
Title: Parse and Extract Data from Excel Templates
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", email = "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads Excel template files using 'tidyxl' and produces a
    guide file where each occupied cell is replaced by a parsable tag
    string encoding the cell's position, type, and content.  The guide
    can then be used to drive downstream data extraction from files that
    follow the same template layout.
